00:06:14.725 --> 00:06:17.923
We're just not quitters
and by the same token,

00:06:17.923 --> 00:06:19.154
we're not apathetic.

00:06:19.154 --> 00:06:22.997
So, we're not going to sit
there and let it, you know.

00:06:22.997 --> 00:06:25.133
