really just friendship.

00:06:33.515 --> 00:06:34.920
I have to tell you.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.846
It's like your partner has
to be your best, best friend.

00:06:37.846 --> 00:06:39.123
And he's my best friend.

00:06:39.123 --> 00:06:41.021
